prompt.user:
Design one fair escape-room puzzle contained entirely within the supplied room.

Puzzle type: logic. Allowed types: code, cipher, riddle, logic, sequence, observation.

No answer was supplied. Choose one answer that is explicitly supported by the supplied room and facts. Do not invent unsupported identifiers or facts.

The answer must be no more than 12 characters and contain only letters, numbers and hyphens. It must contain no spaces. There must be exactly one correct answer.

All clues required to solve the puzzle must be present in the room or supplied facts. Do not rely on outside knowledge or hidden information.

The puzzle_text and clue_locations are player-facing and must not reveal the answer. Put the answer only in the answer field.

ROOM DATA:
{
  "title": "Manhattan Quarantine Zone: Security Control",
  "story_intro": "I'm watching how you approach this dead terminal. The power grid in Manhattan failed long ago, but emergency relays remain.",
  "room_description": "A cramped security post overlooking a blocked avenue in the Manhattan Quarantine Zone. Dust motes drift in the beam of a dying emergency lantern. A muffled rattling echoes against the corrugated steel shutters on the far wall.",
  "objective": "Restore power to the manual override switch and open the exit before the outside barrier gives way.",
  "objects": [
    {
      "name": "Emergency Lantern",
      "description": "Provides a faint, flickering light across the metal desk and casts long shadows against the walls."
    },
    {
      "name": "Control Console",
      "description": "A silent array of switches. The main breaker is offline, requiring the correct circuit sequence from the maintenance log."
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Log",
      "description": "A water-stained clipboard noting that primary power requires linking the blue sector breaker to the secondary grid."
    },
    {
      "name": "Steel Shutters",
      "description": "Heavily bolted from the outside. Something heavy impacts the metal repeatedly, testing the rivets."
    }
  ],
  "chaos_event": {
    "trigger": "Attempting to interact with the control console without the correct sequence",
    "description": "A sudden power surge trips a warning alarm and the rattling at the shutters grows louder and faster."
  },
  "endings": {
    "escaped": "The circuits lock into place, the heavy steel door grinds upward, and you slip out into the quiet New York dusk just in time.",
    "failed": "The time expires, the emergency relays shut down completely, and the sound of failing metal fills the dark room."
  }
}

FACTS:
none

